-- 599: the new homes for the rehomed Sports & Adventure scenes (598 retired the tile, renamed Sports & Arenas to
-- Champions and removed the old tags, but its generator matched the tables as "dual"/"single" while the sort had
-- stored "dual_scenarios"/"single_scenarios", so its tag lists came out empty and it added nothing). This adds them:
-- Champions 482 and Race Track Garage 120 (sports); Nature & Wild 301, Tropical Escapes 74, Beach Towns 57 as
-- category tags (adventure). Nothing read these tags while the scope switch is off. Re-runnable.

-- dual
